you had the nerve to nail me with a jumping knee strike!

00:22:16.086 --> 00:22:16.253
"Anti-Possession Jumping Knee Strike"

00:22:16.336 --> 00:22:18.880
I'm going to make you pay dearly!

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:23.426
I'll make damn sure you
regret what you've done!

00:22:36.940 --> 00:22:42.237
I spilled a seed and lost sight of it

00:22:45.866 --> 00:22:50.745
I'll find it using the color it's dyed in
and watch it grow

00:22:53.456 --> 00:22:59.129
It immediately returned
to the palm of my hand

00:22:59.379 --> 00:23:08.471
But it's still too light and too frail
to reach for the skies

00:23:10.015 --> 00:23:14.311
The world coldly drains away all the heat

00:23:14.561 --> 00:23:18.899
The bright sunshine just isn't enough

00:23:19.149 --> 00:23:23.403
The memories are closing off what lies ahead

00:23:23.653 --> 00:23:28.825
Shake off their warmth
and set off into the distance

00:23:30.076 --> 00:23:35.332
If I let it wither, it'd be over just like that

00:23:35.582 --> 00:23:40.503
But my hope just doesn't fade away

00:23:55.727 --> 00:23:57.687
The new star of the 21st
century, Reigen Arataka!

00:23:57.938 --> 00:23:58.897
He makes his TV debut!

00:23:59.147 --> 00:24:00.857
And on national TV!

00:24:01.107 --> 00:24:03.401
I've finally come this far.
Just you watch, Mob!

00:24:03.652 --> 00:24:05.612
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 Il Episode 7:

00:24:05.862 --> 00:24:06.905
"Cornered
- True Identity~."

00:24:07.155 --> 00:24:09.950
"Cornered - True Identity~" The
Blu-rays? An even better decision.